<!doctype html>
<html class="dark" lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" name="viewport"><meta content="dark" name="color-scheme"><meta content="Callum Ingley&#39;s personal developer website, portfolio, and engineering blog built with Gleam, Wisp, and Lustre." name="description"><meta content="default-src &#39;self&#39;; img-src &#39;self&#39; data:; style-src &#39;self&#39;; font-src &#39;self&#39;; script-src &#39;none&#39;; object-src &#39;none&#39;; base-uri &#39;none&#39;; form-action &#39;none&#39;" http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy"><title>Home | dev_ing</title><link href="/static/styles.css" rel="stylesheet"></head><body class="bg-zinc-950 text-zinc-50"><a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to main content</a><header class="site-header sticky top-0 z-20 border-b border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950/90 backdrop-blur"><div class="site-header-inner"><a class="site-brand" href="/"><span class="text-orange-500">dev</span><span>_ing</span></a><nav aria-label="Primary"><ul class="site-nav-list" role="list"><li><a aria-current="page" class="nav-link nav-link-active text-orange-500 font-semibold" href="/">Home</a></li><li><a class="nav-link text-zinc-300 hover:text-orange-400" href="/projects">Projects</a></li><li><a class="nav-link text-zinc-300 hover:text-orange-400" href="/blog">Blog</a></li><li><a class="nav-link text-zinc-300 hover:text-orange-400" href="/resume">Resume</a></li></ul></nav></div></header><main class="site-main" id="main-content"><!-- lustre:fragment --><div class="bento-section-header mb-8 flex flex-col gap-2"><p class="font-mono text-orange-500 bento-eyebrow">00 // OVERVIEW</p><h1 class="bento-section-title text-zinc-50">Callum Ingley — dev_ing</h1><p class="bento-section-subtitle text-zinc-400">Full-stack software engineer crafting web, mobile, and server-rendered Gleam systems.</p></div><div class="bento-grid grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5"><article class="bento-card rounded-2xl border p-6 flex flex-col gap-4 md:col-span-2 bg-zinc-900 border-orange-500/40 text-zinc-50"><p class="font-mono text-orange-500 bento-eyebrow">01 // ENGINEER</p><h2 class="bento-card-title text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">Server-Rendered Gleam &amp; Full-Stack Craft</h2><div class="bento-card-body flex flex-col gap-3"><div class="hero-profile"><img alt="Portrait of Callum Ingley" class="hero-avatar" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" height="88" src="/static/me.jpg" width="88"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><p class="text-zinc-400">Based in Newcastle, NSW. Building reliable products across TypeScript, Vue/Nuxt, Capacitor mobile, PostgreSQL, AWS, and type-safe functional Gleam on the BEAM.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4"><a class="bento-link" href="/resume">Open Living Resume -&gt;</a><a class="bento-link" href="/projects">Explore Projects -&gt;</a></div></div></div></div></article><article class="bento-card rounded-2xl border p-6 flex flex-col gap-4 md:col-span-1 bg-orange-500 border-orange-400 text-zinc-950"><p class="font-mono bento-eyebrow bento-eyebrow-solid">02 // ARCHITECTURE</p><h2 class="bento-card-title text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">Pure Gleam MPA</h2><div class="bento-card-body flex flex-col gap-3"><p>Shared pure Lustre rendering powers both a live Wisp + Mist HTTP server and a zero-JS static export.</p><ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 list-none p-0 m-0" role="list"><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-700">Gleam v1.18</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-700">Wisp v2.2</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-700">Lustre v5.7</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 border border-zinc-700">Jujutsu</span></li></ul></div></article><article class="bento-card rounded-2xl border p-6 flex flex-col gap-4 md:col-span-2 bg-zinc-900 border-zinc-800 text-zinc-50"><p class="font-mono text-orange-500 bento-eyebrow">03 // FEATURED WORK</p><h2 class="bento-card-title text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">Personal &amp; Commercial Highlights</h2><div class="bento-card-body flex flex-col gap-3"><ul class="bento-list"><li><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold m-0">Dev.Ing</h3><p class="text-sm text-zinc-400">Personal developer portfolio and engineering journal evolving from a client-side Lustre SPA into a server-rendered multi-page Gleam, Wisp, and Mist application with hybrid static GitHub Pages export.</p></li><li><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold m-0">Glelements</h3><p class="text-sm text-zinc-400">Early Lustre UI component library proof-of-concept exploring reusable design tokens and black-and-orange styling in Gleam, whose lessons directly shaped dev_ing_website&#39;s theme-parameterized component primitives.</p></li><li><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold m-0">Wyrd Technology</h3><p class="text-sm text-zinc-400">Cross-platform mobile and web engineering delivering production user workflows across iOS, Android, and modern web frontends.</p></li><li><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold m-0">Grafa</h3><p class="text-sm text-zinc-400">Full-stack engineering on data-rich financial media and analytics applications spanning web interfaces, API services, and cloud infrastructure.</p></li></ul><a class="bento-link" href="/projects">View full project portfolio -&gt;</a></div></article><article class="bento-card rounded-2xl border p-6 flex flex-col gap-4 md:col-span-1 bg-zinc-900 border-zinc-800 text-zinc-50"><p class="font-mono text-orange-500 bento-eyebrow">04 // JOURNAL</p><h2 class="bento-card-title text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">Latest Engineering Notes</h2><div class="bento-card-body flex flex-col gap-3"><ul class="bento-list"><li><a class="bento-link" href="/blog/what-is-jj">Read Experimenting with VCS other than Git (Jujutsu)</a><p class="text-xs text-zinc-400">2026-11-18</p></li><li><a class="bento-link" href="/blog/what-is-dev-ing">Read What is Dev_Ing?</a><p class="text-xs text-zinc-400">2026-11-11</p></li></ul><a class="bento-link" href="/blog">Browse all blog posts -&gt;</a></div></article><article class="bento-card rounded-2xl border p-6 flex flex-col gap-4 md:col-span-3 bg-zinc-900 border-zinc-800 text-zinc-50"><p class="font-mono text-orange-500 bento-eyebrow">05 // LIVING RESUME</p><h2 class="bento-card-title text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">Experience Timeline &amp; Capabilities</h2><div class="bento-card-body flex flex-col gap-3"><p class="text-zinc-400">Full career history spanning Grafa (2021–2026), Wyrd Technology (2024–2025), Akora Property, The West Australian, and UWA Computer &amp; Mathematical Sciences.</p><ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 list-none p-0 m-0" role="list"><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">TypeScript</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">Gleam</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">Vue &amp; Nuxt</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">Capacitor Mobile</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">PostgreSQL</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">AWS</span></li></ul></div></article></div><!-- /lustre:fragment --></main><footer class="site-footer"><div class="site-footer-inner"><p class="m-0 text-zinc-400">Callum Ingley · Built with Gleam, Wisp, and Lustre</p><a class="bento-link" href="https://github.com/kazlim-code" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">GitHub (@kazlim-code)</a></div></footer></body></html>
